   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca8c79aca10c0069e36e33",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "eddie",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8c79aca10c0069e36e33",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "As a followup, I believe the following corrections need to be made:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "1. declare default namespace, e.g.: xmlns=\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/access/"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/access/",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": "\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "2. correct schemaLocation to: xsi:schemaLocation=\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/access/"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/access/",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.fedora-commons.org/definitions/1/0/listDatastreams.xsd"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.fedora-commons.org/definitions/1/0/listDatastreams.xsd",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": "\"",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Finally, it looks like we're serializing the listDatastreams response in two different places (ListDatastreamsServlet and DefaultSerializer), depending on whether it's in response to a SOAP or REST call and in the latter case, we're providing an invalid location, e.g. ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://localhost:8080/listDatastreams.xsd"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://localhost:8080/listDatastreams.xsd",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
