      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/64bf6f26854d620d318d4082f2e6a6a7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FE-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "eddie",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8c79aca10c0069e36e33",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>As a followup, I believe the following corrections need to be made:<br/>\n1. declare default namespace, e.g.: xmlns=\"http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/access/\"<br/>\n2. correct schemaLocation to: xsi:schemaLocation=\"http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/access/ <a href=\"http://www.fedora-commons.org/definitions/1/0/listDatastreams.xsd\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.fedora-commons.org/definitions/1/0/listDatastreams.xsd</a>\"</p>\n\n<p>Finally, it looks like we're serializing the listDatastreams response in two different places (ListDatastreamsServlet and DefaultSerializer), depending on whether it's in response to a SOAP or REST call and in the latter case, we're providing an invalid location, e.g. <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/listDatastreams.xsd\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/listDatastreams.xsd</a></p>",
     "created": "29/May/10 12:05 AM",
     "id": "11406",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10687/comment/11406",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "5fca8c79aca10c0069e36e33",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
