  "description": "<p>listDatastreams request (format=xml) returns a response that does not validate. For example, <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects/fedora-system:ContentModel-3.0/datastreams?format=xml\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects/fedora-system:ContentModel-3.0/datastreams?format=xml</a></p>\n\n<p>returns a response that is missing the default namespace declaration, and the schemaLocation has an invalid location (at least via REST API)</p>",
